# 3. Alert Model


* The original raw log line is always preserved.
* Web requests are URL-decoded before detection.
* Each log type has its own parser.
| `raw`       | Original log line, preserved unchanged |

## 2.3 Event processing requirements

 `details`   | Additional event-specific information  |
 `outcome`   | Result of the action                   |
 `dst_ip`    | Destination IP address                 |
 `user`      | Associated username, when available    |
 `dst_port`  | Destination port                       |
 `src_port`  | Source port                            |
 `timestamp` | Time at which the event occurred       |
 `event_id`
 `host`
 `log_type`
 `category`
 `action`
 `src_ip`
 `raw`
